	'k12ff8025' => 'Dogs &amp; cats',
	'k180dbe9f' => 'Monday to Friday, 9:00–12:30 and 15:30–19:00. Saturday, 9:00–12:30 and 15:30–17:00. Sunday and public holidays, closed. Urgent same-day slots run on weekdays. Out of hours, contact the regional emergency hospital.',
