	'k1a263945' => 'A large part of diagnosis happens in the building. We run blood tests in-house, and we have digital X-ray and ultrasound. Dr. Tomás Ribeiro leads dentistry and imaging, so the pictures that guide a dental procedure or an internal case are read here, with the clinician who is looking after your animal.',
	'k1bf982e3' => 'A nurse calls within 48 hours of a visit. The discharge call after surgery sits with the same nursing team. Questions about fasting, carriers, medicines and bills can start with Clara, and she will bring in a nurse or a doctor when the question needs them. The desk phone is +1 555 0142 300. The email is hello@aobavet.example.',
