	'k2a1f83ea' => 'Time, clarity and calm',
	'k2b1f94ef' => 'Book',
	'k2b75276e' => 'Her story is not a promise about another cat with weight loss. Every animal is different. It does show how a long-term feline case is held here, by the same doctor, on a schedule you can put in a diary. If your cat is losing weight, drinking more, or hiding more than usual, book a 30-minute consultation. The fee is $65, and any medicine is written on an estimate first.',
	'k2bf28856' => 'You are shown the findings in the room. If medicine, a further test or a procedure is the next step, the fee is written down before anything starts. Many problems are settled at this level. Some move on to surgery, dentistry or a senior blood panel, and the consultation is where that decision is explained. Book by phone on +1 555 0142 300 or by email at hello@aobavet.example.',
	'k2c16e1a6' => 'Quiet · Apart · Gentle',
	'k2df20e34' => 'Dr. Priya Nair leads feline medicine, and the handling standard is the same whoever is in the room. We use the least restraint that still lets us examine properly. A towel, a quiet voice and an owner who can stay and hold a settled cat are part of the method. If a cat needs a moment before the stethoscope or the ear exam, we take the moment inside the booked time.',
	'k2df70611' => 'Our clinic',
	'k2ea16c1b' => 'How we examine, explain and plan',
	'k3122e156' => 'Published prices, a written estimate first',
