	'k6d4d67e2' => 'General practice · Surgery · Dentistry — Fairhaven since 2014',
	'k6e22cf21' => 'Diet is discussed in the consultation, starting from the food you already feed. Bring the name of that food, or a photo of the bag, and mention anything else your dog or cat eats, including leftovers and treats. If a change is worth making, it is written into the plan in words you can shop with. We do not tie that advice to a single manufacturer.',
	'k72572def' => 'Calm, careful medicine <br>for the dogs and cats you love.',
	'k747b932a' => 'Both fees include tax. Both are the same on this page, at the desk, and in any estimate that quotes them. Dr. Elena Varga set the clinic up in 2014 so that this conversation would have a clear price and a clear length. If you are unsure which visit you need, call +1 555 0142 300 and a nurse will help you choose.',
	'k74b4095f' => 'A limp, a quiet cat, or a day without food is reason enough to come in.',
