	'k76ff99bb' => 'A smaller clinic was the point. The first conversation with an owner can last long enough to hear the real history, and the people who do the surgery, the dentistry and the nursing are colleagues on the same corridor, not a distant department. Fairhaven has been the setting since that opening year. The phone is +1 555 0142 300 and the desk email is hello@aobavet.example.',
	'k78aff160' => 'A small clinic that takes the time to listen.',
	'k7bbf280c' => 'Dental scale and polish is done under anaesthesia, not in a quick conscious scrape. The published fee starts from $320, and the written estimate for your animal replaces that starting figure once Dr. Tomás Ribeiro has examined the mouth. He will show you what he finds. Decisions about teeth are made with you on the estimate, before the anaesthetic is booked.',
	'k7c5ba892' => 'Director',
	'k7df54813' => 'Appointments are kept to that booked length so the visit itself stays short. Ears, teeth, weight and heart are still examined. Low-stress handling is not a skipped examination. It is a full examination done in an order the cat can tolerate. Tell us what has helped at other visits, and what has not, when you sit down.',
	'k7e51e90e' => 'Soft-tissue and joint surgery, including Biscuit’s cruciate repair.',
	'k7e9e1e76' => 'Clara Moreau',
	'k7ef92867' => 'Come in, or at least call, if you are seeing any of these. Not eating for more than a day. Limping that lasts beyond 24 hours. Drinking much more than usual. Repeated vomiting or diarrhoea. Scratching ears or shaking the head. Breathing faster at rest. A cat hiding more than usual.',
	'k7fafdf24' => 'Elena Varga opened it in 2014. Cats should come in carriers. Dogs should come on leads. The cat waiting room is inside, separate from the space where dogs wait. If you cannot find the door, call +1 555 0142 300 and Clara Moreau or a colleague will describe the front from where you are standing.',
	'k80186b3a' => 'The estimate is how a cruciate repair, an endoscopy or a dental decision stays specific to the animal in front of us. Published “from” prices are starting points. The estimate is the price for your dog or your cat. It is also the document that matches what the insurer, if you have one, will later see.',
	'k80502fcb' => 'Published fees, in US dollars. Prices include tax. You always get a written estimate first.',
	'k80a0c205' => 'Opening hours',
	'k817d7f6d' => 'Most dogs and cats who come to Aoba Veterinary Clinic are not in crisis. An appetite has dropped, a walk has shortened, or an owner wants a proper look before a small change becomes a larger one. We are one clinic on Alder Street in Fairhaven, founded in 2014, and we see dogs and cats only. Appointments are long enough to hear the history rather than fit it into a few minutes.',
	'k8295669a' => 'Cats are seen in their own waiting room, with a quiet arrival, pheromone diffusers, and appointments kept to the booked length.',
	'k858eb1c3' => 'When we are closed, an emergency belongs with the regional emergency hospital. Your first visit will be placed in one of the open blocks, and the confirmation will say which. If you need a senior blood panel, a vaccination or a dental consultation, the same hours apply. Phone +1 555 0142 300. Email hello@aobavet.example. The address is 214 Alder Street, Fairhaven, and the clinic has been here since 2014.',
	'k86892af6' => 'The room can be run for cats because the day is not also trying to serve every other species. You stay with your cat. If the consult room is free, we move you through rather than parking the carrier for a long stretch. The same room is used for a routine vaccination and for a cat who comes back every few months for a long-term condition.',
	'k88d1d043' => 'First consultation, $65',
	'k8a89d63c' => 'Annual vaccination (dog DHPP or cat FVRCP), incl. check',
	'k8ab594be' => 'Monday to Friday: 9:00–12:30 and 15:30–19:00. Saturday: 9:00–12:30 and 15:30–17:00. Saturday afternoon is the shorter session. Sunday and public holidays: closed. Book into an open block. The desk cannot make an appointment in the middle of the day, between 12:30 and 15:30, or on a Sunday.',
	'k8b24ff33' => 'Separate waiting room',
	'k8e661738' => 'If you are unsure whether something can wait until morning, call us while we are open. A nurse will tell you whether it can wait. Dogs and cats only. The people on the other end of the phone are the same team who work in the consult rooms.',
	'k8f4fca40' => 'Biscuit, a beagle aged 7, came to the clinic with a cruciate ligament injury. Dr. Samuel Osei repaired it. The plan and the fee were set out in a written estimate before surgery, and Biscuit went home with pain relief and instructions for the first days.',
	'k8f7f4c1c' => 'About',
	'k900fda63' => 'Lumps that change size. If you are unsure, call us — a nurse will tell you whether it can wait. Urgent same-day slots are there for weekdays. None of these signs diagnoses the cause by itself. They are reasons to let Dr. Elena Varga and her colleagues examine the animal. A quiet change in a cat, such as the weight loss Juniper showed, is as worth a call as a dramatic limp. Bring the video if the sign comes and goes.',
	'k90544a8a' => 'Quiet appointments for cats, in a room of their own.',
	'k90adc080' => 'Quiet arrival',
	'k91224b01' => '214 Alder Street',
	'k94027a0e' => 'What a written estimate includes',
	'k94ac755e' => 'Follow up',
	'k94ccad2d' => 'Dr. Elena Varga opened Aoba Veterinary Clinic in 2014 after twelve years in a city referral hospital. She chose a street-level practice in Fairhaven, and the address has stayed 214 Alder Street. The work is general practice for dogs and cats, with surgery and dentistry in the same building, led by a director whose own field is internal medicine.',
	'k950bfa45' => 'Dental care, digital X-ray, ultrasound and endoscopy.',
	'k95af1773' => 'Juniper is a cat of 12. She came because of weight loss, and Dr. Priya Nair found a thyroid condition. It is managed with daily medication and with checks every 3 months. Those return visits are ordinary days in the cat waiting room: a carrier, a short wait, an examination, and a clear note of what to do until the next check.',
	'k97f19eb5' => 'Nutrition comes up at vaccination visits, during senior care, and when an animal is losing or gaining weight. Juniper, a cat of 12, came because of weight loss, and the answer was a thyroid condition rather than a new bag of food. The food list still mattered, because it kept the history honest. Your first consultation is the right place to begin.',
	'k982976b7' => 'Care at Aoba Veterinary Clinic is organised around dogs, cats, and surgery and dental work. Dogs are seen for everyday medicine, prevention and the injuries that need Dr. Samuel Osei, whose field is surgery and orthopaedics. Cats are seen with feline medicine led by Dr. Priya Nair, in a clinic that keeps a separate cat waiting room.',
	'k988f82d8' => 'It is not a timetable we offer to every animal. Every animal is different, and another dog with a cruciate repair may need longer, or a different plan, under the same surgeons and nurses. The full account of Biscuit’s case is on the stories page, beside Juniper and Otto, each told on its own.',
	'k9906c684' => 'Your first visit',
	'k992a0f05' => 'Services',
	'k9c8172c1' => 'Dr. Samuel Osei',
	'k9e3bb09a' => 'Signs that are worth a visit',
	'k9e6f7973' => 'Dental care',
	'ka0161f91' => 'Dr. Tomás Ribeiro',
	'ka3c5ac3b' => 'Dogs and cats',
	'ka5e25c20' => 'Malik Haddad',
	'ka627bb42' => 'General practice · Surgery · Dentistry',
	'ka7757f5f' => 'Planned surgery and dental work start with an examination and a written estimate, before a date is kept. The estimate names the procedure, the anaesthetic and monitoring, pain relief, and the fee. You have it before treatment is booked. Fasting rules are given for that animal at that booking. We tell you when food should stop and whether a drink of water is still right. There is no single fasting time printed for every dog and cat, because the instruction depends on the patient and the procedure.',
	'ka77c4fb5' => 'Surgery and dental care are planned with a written estimate, monitored anaesthesia, pain relief, and a discharge call after you get home.',
	'ka90646e4' => 'Cats of every age, thyroid and long-term conditions, and the quiet cat room.',
	'kac0a7dca' => 'It can sit beside the annual vaccination visit, which remains $58 including the check, or it can be booked because something has changed. Drinking much more than usual, a coat that has dulled, or a cat hiding more than usual are reasons to come before the year is up. We would rather see an older animal while a change is still small. Follow-up consultations are 15 minutes at $45, and long-term conditions are reviewed on a schedule you can see in advance.',
	'kac6914bc' => 'A first visit is a 30-minute consultation: you book, you arrive, and we examine, explain and write the plan before treatment.',
	'kac848fa2' => 'Team',
	'kad7dc0fc' => 'Exam &amp; plan',
	'kae414790' => 'Call +1 555 0142 300 during opening hours. Email hello@aobavet.example at any time and Clara Moreau will answer on the next working morning, or sooner when the desk is staffed. On Sunday and on public holidays the clinic is closed, even when a holiday falls on a weekday we would otherwise be open. Out of hours, and for an emergency that cannot wait until the next open block, contact the regional emergency hospital. We do not publish a second number, because that hospital is not ours.',
	'kaf179bed' => 'Monitored anaesthesia, pain relief and a named surgeon.',
