	'kb314a28d' => 'Breathing faster at rest',
	'kb37d593a' => 'On the day, cats go to the separate waiting room and dogs are settled away from it. A nurse calls within 48 hours after the visit. If you need to change the time, call the same number, +1 555 0142 300, or write again to hello@aobavet.example. Clara Moreau keeps the book.',
	'kb4310a9b' => 'first consultation, 30 minutes, full examination',
	'kb526b31a' => 'Founder and clinic director',
	'kb6796496' => 'Dogs and cats wait in different rooms. The cat waiting room is arranged for carriers: a place to set them down, a towel if the carrier floor needs one, and pheromone diffusers in the room itself. It is a quiet part of the clinic, away from dogs arriving for their own appointments. That separation is one reason Aoba Veterinary Clinic sees dogs and cats only.',
	'kb8abf288' => 'Book by email at hello@aobavet.example or by phone on +1 555 0142 300, and call before you come if the case is urgent.',
	'kba551cf4' => 'A consultation is the centre of general practice here. The first one lasts 30 minutes, includes a full examination, and costs $65. A follow-up lasts 15 minutes and costs $45. Dr. Elena Varga, clinic director, sees internal medicine cases and is responsible for the standard of that conversation: what we heard, what we found, and what we propose.',
	'kbb679f93' => 'Urgent same-day slots sit inside the weekday blocks. A first consultation is 30 minutes. A follow-up is 15 minutes. If you are booking a cat, a dental visit or a surgery admit, the confirmation names the block you are in. The hours are the same ones printed in the footer of this site and given on the phone. We would rather tell you them twice than have you arrive when the door is shut.',
	'kbc61dc76' => 'Dr. Osei and Dr. Ribeiro, with monitored anaesthesia.',
	'kbc713a09' => 'Surgery day',
	'kbdd48bb7' => 'Bring the vaccination record if you have it. Bring a list of the food your dog or cat eats and a list of any medicines, including anything bought without a prescription. If the problem is something you can record, bring a photo or a short video of the symptom: a limp on a walk, a cough, scratching at an ear, or a cat hiding. The picture is often clearer than a description given an hour later in a strange room.',
	'kbe5cfdf6' => 'Lumps that change size',
	'kbf8cbcbd' => 'Settle in',
	'kbfd1be79' => 'Repeated vomiting or diarrhoea',
	'kc2f44eba' => 'Cats wait apart from dogs, away from noise.',
	'kc3b0b5dc' => 'Veterinary nurse, rehabilitation',
	'kc3b91970' => 'If a procedure has already been planned, follow the fasting times we gave you for that animal. For a first consultation there is usually no fast. If you are unsure, call before you leave home. A nurse will tell you whether it can wait, and whether to bring the carrier covered, the lead, or the morning dose of a medicine you already give.',
	'kc45eaedb' => 'A separate waiting room',
	'kc7df814b' => 'Planned, monitored, explained',
	'kcaaf7739' => 'Dogs, cats, surgery and dental',
	'kcaea8d1d' => 'Time is the first value. The 30-minute first consultation, and the 15-minute follow-up, exist so the history and the examination are done properly and the plan is explained before anyone is asked to agree. Clarity is the second. We show you what we find, and we write the estimate before treatment. The fee list is public, from the $65 first consultation to a dental scale and polish under anaesthesia from $320. You should be able to read what a visit may cost before you are at the desk.',
	'kce9a703d' => 'A written estimate, fasting advice and time for questions.',
	'kcebb771d' => 'Older dogs and cats are a steady part of the week. Dr. Elena Varga’s internal medicine work often means watching appetite, thirst, weight and energy, then deciding whether a senior blood panel will add something the examination cannot. The panel is $110.',
	'kcf6586f7' => 'Nutrition',
	'kd2479693' => 'Microchip and registration, when an animal does not yet have a chip, is $49. Prevention here is these published items plus the examination that comes with them, not a bundle of unnamed extras. Anything beyond the vaccination and the check is written as its own estimate. Puppies, kittens and adult boosters are booked as consultations, so the check is a real  appointment rather than a stop at the door. Prices include tax.',
	'kd2c7682d' => 'Book · Arrive · Plan',
	'kd6d50ec4' => 'Email a booking request',
	'kd8afbc54' => 'Recovery',
	'kd8b7c739' => 'I founded Aoba Veterinary Clinic in 2014, <br>after twelve years in a city referral hospital. <br>We see dogs and cats only, at 214 Alder Street in Fairhaven. <br>A first consultation is 30 minutes, so the history is heard in full. <br>I direct the clinic and practise internal medicine. <br>Surgery, feline medicine, dentistry and nursing are done <br>by named colleagues in this building. <br>You will be shown what we find, <br>and have a written estimate before treatment. <br>The people who will look after your animal are on the team page.',
	'kd9e0d93f' => 'Weekdays keep same-day slots for problems that should not wait. We will tell you to come to 214 Alder Street when a slot is the right step, and we will point you to the regional emergency hospital when it is not. A first consultation is 30 minutes at $65. A follow-up is 15 minutes at $45. We see dogs and cats only.',
	'kda99671b' => 'Surgery and orthopaedics',
	'kdd296825' => 'Symptoms',
	'kde9f1638' => 'A discharge call and a nurse’s check within 48 hours.',
	'kded297c0' => 'The clinic is at 214 Alder Street, Fairhaven, with 6 parking spaces, a local bus along Alder Street, and published weekday and Saturday hours.',
	'kdfb0e8f3' => 'from $240',
	'kdfdb6bb3' => 'Findings are explained in plain language before we talk about treatment. A senior blood panel, when it is the right test, is $110 and is listed with the other fees. Imaging and laboratory work that we advise are named on the written estimate, with the fee, before we proceed. The same standard holds for a limping dog, a cat losing weight, or a dental mouth we have only glanced at in the consult room.',
	'kdfe33fad' => 'Scratching ears or shaking the head',
	'ke0344c32' => 'Some changes can be watched for a day. Others should be seen sooner. If your dog or cat seems clearly unwell, call the clinic. On weekdays we keep urgent same-day slots, and a nurse can tell you whether to come in or whether it can wait until a booked visit.',
	'ke159729b' => 'Dentistry and imaging',
	'ke1783061' => 'Before you leave, a nurse goes through written notes: rest, the medicines prescribed for your animal, food and water, and what should prompt a call. Pain relief is the plan you already agreed, sent home with instructions for that patient. A discharge call checks the first hours after you are back. The clinic’s follow-up call still comes within 48 hours of a visit. Hannah Lindqvist, head veterinary nurse, leads the nursing team that makes those calls. If recovery needs rehabilitation, Malik Haddad writes the plan.',
	'ke22b31ad' => 'Dr. Elena Varga leads Aoba Veterinary Clinic with colleagues in surgery, feline medicine, dentistry, nursing, rehabilitation and reception.',
	'ke247d21a' => 'Symptoms · Method · Recovery',
	'ke4333cab' => 'Hannah Lindqvist',
	'ke64629de' => 'Consultations',
	'ke6eec068' => 'Nursing and reception',
	'ke6f42fec' => 'You see what we find and get a written estimate first.',
	'ke7143c92' => 'Arrive',
	'ke74fae46' => 'By appointment, with urgent same-day slots',
	'ke79c6603' => 'Meet the team',
	'ke7d94e77' => 'Towels, calm hands and no rush on the table.',
	'ke8105880' => 'Aoba Veterinary Clinic, 214 Alder Street, Fairhaven.',
	'ke8baeb46' => 'Email, phone, or call before you come',
	'ke92bbbfe' => 'Leads the nursing team, admissions and the discharge calls.',
	'kebac13a7' => 'There are three ways to arrange a visit. Email hello@aobavet.example with your name, a phone number, the animal’s name, whether they are a dog or a cat, and the reason you want to come. That message is the online request. Or call +1 555 0142 300 during opening hours and book with Clara Moreau or a nurse. The third way is for urgent cases only: call first, then come.',
	'kebd0db45' => 'Dr. Elena Varga is founder and clinic director, and her field is internal medicine. She opened the clinic in 2014 after twelve years in a city referral hospital. Dr. Samuel Osei’s field is surgery and orthopaedics, and he performed Biscuit’s cruciate ligament repair. Dr. Priya Nair’s field is feline medicine, and she manages Juniper’s thyroid condition.',
	'kebfbf9b3' => 'Senior blood panel',
	'kec49e987' => 'Urgent? Call before you come.',
	'kecbd4ac2' => 'Juniper’s visits',
	'kecdbc6fc' => 'Cat spay or neuter starts from $240. Dog spay or neuter starts from $380. A dental scale and polish under anaesthesia starts from $320. Orthopaedic work, such as a cruciate ligament repair, is estimated individually because it is not one of the eight published lines. Prices include tax.',
	'kedf7553d' => 'Find us',
	'kee0a8766' => 'By email or phone, with the signs and how long they have lasted.',
	'kf0292604' => 'from surgery to full walks',
	'kf0cd45ee' => '10 weeks',
	'kf0f5effe' => 'Head veterinary nurse',
	'kf4878c24' => 'You can pay by card or by cash. If you have pet insurance, we fill in the claim forms for you. Bring the policy details you already use, and we will complete the clinic’s part of the paperwork from the record of the visit and from the written estimate. We do not name insurers and we do not add a fee for filling the forms.',
	'kf54d128d' => 'A word from the director',
	'kf6166df5' => 'Cat spay / neuter',
	'kf68ed177' => 'A written estimate sets out what we found, what we propose to do, and what it will cost. It is given before treatment, including before a vaccination extra, a senior blood panel, a spay or neuter, a dental scale and polish, or a surgery that is not on the published list. You can read it at the clinic or take it home. Treatment starts after you have agreed it. If the plan has to change on the day, we tell you and write the new figure before we go further.',
	'kf77ccbdb' => 'Doctors',
	'kf9979bb6' => 'In the consult room we show you what we find. In-house blood tests, digital X-ray and ultrasound are available here when the examination calls for them. Any treatment waits until you have a written estimate.',
	'kfa2ac0a1' => 'Cat care',
	'kfa659ab7' => 'Malik Haddad, veterinary nurse for rehabilitation, wrote the rehab plan. Over 10 weeks Biscuit returned to full walks. His owner said he was back on his morning walk by spring. That span, from surgery to full walks, is what happened for this one dog.',
	'kfb4abec4' => 'Thirty-minute first consultations',
	'kfb9e5d38' => 'Aoba Veterinary Clinic was founded in 2014 by Dr. Elena Varga at 214 Alder Street, Fairhaven, after twelve years in a city referral hospital.',
	'kfbeca1af' => 'Surgery &amp; dental',
	'kfc18f74a' => 'A follow-up consultation is 15 minutes at $45, which is enough to judge whether a plan is working. The longer first visit is how a small clinic takes the time to listen. It is also why we ask you to book, rather than hoping to be seen between other animals. Urgent same-day slots still exist on weekdays, and they are arranged by phone.',
	'kfc258426' => 'Dr. Tomás Ribeiro’s field is dentistry and imaging, and he removed Otto’s swallowed sock by endoscopy. The four of them share one caseload of dogs and cats at 214 Alder Street. A case moves between them when the problem asks for it, and the owner still has a written estimate before treatment and a named person to ask. First consultations are 30 minutes. The director’s standard is that the explanation should be understandable without a medical dictionary.',
	'kfd289ff8' => 'Dogs · Cats · Surgery',
	'kfd46a268' => 'A first consultation is 30 minutes and the fee is $65. The length is deliberate. It covers a full examination, time to hear how the problem started, and time to explain what we find in ordinary language. Treatment is not started in the same breath as the diagnosis. You receive a written estimate first, and prices on the published list include tax.',
	'kfda36b19' => 'Before · Surgery · Home',
	'kfe170811' => 'Surgery and dentistry cover planned procedures, from neutering to dental scale and polish under anaesthesia, with imaging led by Dr. Tomás Ribeiro. All of it sits in one building at 214 Alder Street, Fairhaven, opened in 2014. Each of these paths has its own page: cat care, surgery and dental, and the fee list. A written estimate comes before treatment on every one of them.',
	'kfe28e203' => 'Microchip and registration',
	'kfe596c1e' => 'Surgery and dental',
	'search_results' => 'Search results for: %s',
);
